      "text": "1. Start with left most child of current node .\n\n2. Print Data .\n\n3. Check its thread \n  \n  a. IF thread is 1 , this means it is pointing to its successor . So move to successor and goto step 2.\n\n  b.. If thread is 0 , this meand it is pointing to child move to child and go to step 1.\n\n4. Reapeat the steps untill you find the node whose right is NULL . In this case you stop and return .",
